# RoBERTa (FacebookAI/roberta-large-mnli) vs xleplusglue, for the computational semantics seminar.
# Settings: session pronouns-new (lfgxdrt inference grammar, no TAM rules, pragmatics rules,
# tff, no model building, anaphora top-k = 1). x01-x23: xleplusglue right, RoBERTa wrong;
# x24-x29: both right (contrast). Each item names where its xleplusglue verdict was checked.

